    "detailed_description": "In this relaxing puzzle game, your goal is simple: destroy all the blocks and reach the heart block, which can't be destroyed. Other blocks vary in health, while the dark purple &quot;domino&quot; block can only be cleared with a special crystal.<br><br>Enjoy the chill vibes with adorable hand-drawn art and a soothing soundtrack that helps you unwind while guiding the main characters to finally meet. It's the perfect way to relax and immerse yourself in a heartwarming puzzle experience!<br><br>Features: <br><br><strong>Charming Art: </strong>Adorable hand-drawn visuals.<br><strong>Relaxing Puzzles:</strong> Destroy blocks to reach the heart block.<br><strong>Special Mechanics: </strong>Use crystals for &quot;domino&quot; blocks.<br><strong>Soothing Soundtrack: </strong>Calming music to enhance the experience.<br><strong>Casual Fun:</strong> Easygoing gameplay for relaxation.",
