    "short_description": "In this relaxing puzzle game, destroy blocks and reach the heart block, which can't be destroyed. Clear tougher blocks and use crystals to break special &quot;domino&quot; blocks. With charming art and a soothing soundtrack, help the main characters meet while you unwind and enjoy the chill vibes!",
